 >> [2026-02-27 01:28] decide — preserve existing register APIs (`set/get/yank/paste`) and add phase facets as additive metadata, not a breaking schema reset.
 >> [2026-02-27 01:28] decide — split selector semantics into operational and positional dimensions to reduce ambiguity for projection/reduction/objective/subjective queries.
 >> [2026-02-27 01:28] taste — prefer a minimal invariant core with optional enrichment per stage, so early pipeline stays deterministic and cheap.
 >> [2026-02-27 01:31] decide — keep `parse` and `sem` as coarse buckets for this increment.
 >> [2026-02-27 01:31] decide — selector surface is Spw-native grammar first (not preset-only aliases).
