 >> [2026-02-27 01:46] ship — types: RegisterPhase, PhaseFacet (memoryWeight), PhaseEnvelope (evictable), RegisterAddress, PHASE_ORDER
 >> [2026-02-27 01:46] ship — RegisterBank: enrichPhase(), phaseOf(), phase-aware set(), advancePhase() with weight
 >> [2026-02-27 01:46] ship — 5 new tests: progressive enrichment, phase-annotated set, unphased cells, memoryWeight derivation, snapshot immutability
 >> [2026-02-27 01:46] taste — progressive enhancement: facets additive, value preserved through enrichment. Spw serialization: phase maps 1:1 to !phase[] modifier tags. memory granularity: PHASE_ORDER drives eviction priority.
 >> [2026-03-05 19:06] ship — P0 runtime stabilization merged on `main` via `181071e`; build, lint, and test are green again.
 >> [2026-03-05 19:06] revise — replace shorthand phase language (`sem`, `opt`, `prag`) in active planning surfaces with canonical names (`semantic`, `optimize`, `pragmatic`).
 >> [2026-03-05 19:06] revise — narrow the remaining branch scope to selector grammar, `spwq` wiring, and docs alignment; the build-fix work is no longer part of this plan.
 >> [2026-03-05 19:06] hygiene — `src/runtime/state/register-helpers.ts` is untracked extraction drift duplicating helpers still defined in `register-bank.ts`; leave it out of this branch.
 >> [2026-03-05 19:06] taste — keep the next increment narrow; chemistry/metaphysics redesign should sit on top of a query/docs-aligned baseline and truthful audits.
